                                "sense_id": "c18f3de9-c9f1-36e2-8af9-d86535c35a67",
                                "text": "But thy free bounty, undebased by pride, Prompt to anticipate the meek request, Unask'd the wants of modest Worth supplied, And spared the pang that shook the suppliant's breast."
